{"steam_appid":5130480,"steam_name":"Sort The Capybaras","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5130480/1795435021/2767287d8c0873f42f2006798a3fc3afbcec8c77/1788512735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788513355","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257417106/f6c136e6844761bd4e465639cc14ccc2167dc38e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788513355","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/ab9d61f16dd1a2a608bb9d6e3ec09e0b7d6f5354/ss_ab9d61f16dd1a2a608bb9d6e3ec09e0b7d6f5354.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791542435","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/09429c0621a2d05f55509e28cd80bb6fc9b18886/ss_09429c0621a2d05f55509e28cd80bb6fc9b18886.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791542435","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/37daf2e0888120a1be5e2d9dedcf2a1655068f2f/ss_37daf2e0888120a1be5e2d9dedcf2a1655068f2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791542435","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/320a87b3ccc87fda710ac468f7d01ce66a6024c5/ss_320a87b3ccc87fda710ac468f7d01ce66a6024c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791542435","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/fb638a5b588f1562b546d90c17308fb83fd1d561/ss_fb638a5b588f1562b546d90c17308fb83fd1d561.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791542435"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort The Capybaras</strong> is a cozy organizing game. You are in a messy capybara store with 4,800 cute capybara toys. Pick up a capybara and identify the type of the capybara and then place them on the correct shelves. You will earn money for every capybara you sort. Use your money to upgrade sorting abilities, then you can sort faster and faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/a5061473c2502079b0978e6229f77eca.poster.avif?t=1791542435\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/a5061473c2502079b0978e6229f77eca.webm?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/a5061473c2502079b0978e6229f77eca.mp4?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort Capybaras to Earn Money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put a capybara onto the correct shelf will immediately give you money. Pick a capybara on the floor, look at it and look at the signboard on the shelf, you will easily find the shelf it belongs to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/bd4e82ef4bed6f9b88f497201b1aedf5.poster.avif?t=1791542435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/bd4e82ef4bed6f9b88f497201b1aedf5.webm?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/bd4e82ef4bed6f9b88f497201b1aedf5.mp4?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Chaos to Organized</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store starts with compeletely chaos, you can fill the shelves one by one. Finally, the store will be tidy and perfectly organized.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superpower for sorting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock superpower abilities for sorting by spending money. Highlight the same type of capybaras, carry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More capybaras at once, automatically highlight correct shelves, immediatelly collect all the same type of capybaras from the whole store to you hand, automatically collect same type of capybaras nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/e651a976efab90ea3c004dd09e22cef3.poster.avif?t=1791542435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/e651a976efab90ea3c004dd09e22cef3.webm?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/e651a976efab90ea3c004dd09e22cef3.mp4?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/4da1f0ae41802fe4fc5d546fa1e13b17.poster.avif?t=1791542435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/4da1f0ae41802fe4fc5d546fa1e13b17.webm?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/extras/4da1f0ae41802fe4fc5d546fa1e13b17.mp4?t=1791542435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Superpower for sorting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock superpower abilities for sorting by spending money. Highlight the same type of capybaras, carry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More capybaras at once, automatically highlight correct shelves, immediatelly collect all the same type of capybaras from the whole store to you hand, automatically collect same type of capybaras nearby.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support 4 players to join the game. You can create lobby and play with your friends on Steam.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 12700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["CapybaraKoala"],"publishers":["CapybaraKoala"],"release_date":"Oct 8, 2026"}